WEBVTT

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:33.070
Kourin was deep in thought.

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:36.650
Is there a lady called Kourin-san in here?

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:40.870
I've brought a message from Shuurei-onee-chan.

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:56.720
Shuurei-sama said to use this sleeping medicine on the others?

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:02.510
Yep, she wants the captive villagers to pretend they're dead.

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:05.430
Apparently they can get out that way.

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:11.020
I see. If they're thought to be dead,
they'll be removed and can then run away.

00:02:12.310 --> 00:02:13.860
A brilliant idea from Shuurei-sama.

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:16.320
Please tell her that I understand her plan.

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:16.900
Okay!

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:24.370
The villagers could escape.

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:25.740
After that,

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:29.120
Kourin had only one concern on her mind.

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:33.040
Eigetsu-sama...

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:48.230
Did it go well?

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:49.230
Yes!

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:51.730
Good. Well done!

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:06.740
What?

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:11.920
I spilled the water. May I go and fetch some more?

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:14.420
Don't take too long.

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:19.010
Thank you.

00:03:29.470 --> 00:03:31.020
My soul friend number one...

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:34.560
I will go ahead and meet number two first.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:45.240
Hold on, friend number two.

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:46.580
Eigetsu!

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.540
Well then, I'd better get going too.

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:12.230
From what the others said, there's something over there.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:27.450
Eigetsu-sama!

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:33.320
How terrible...

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.250
Eigetsu-sama!

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:37.710
Who's done such a terrible thing to you?

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:47.510
Kourin-san?

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:53.730
Why... are you here?

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:56.440
Why...

00:04:57.350 --> 00:04:59.060
You ask that?

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:03.030
What's this?! How could you be so stupid as to get caught in a place like this?!

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:07.570
I'm sorry.

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:09.370
I meant to say...

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:14.290
Don't get me wrong. I didn't come after you.

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:15.790
Oh...

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:20.210
I intended to smack you and tell you off.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:22.670
But...

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:25.090
But...

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:33.390
Now that I've found you after all that, you still won't let me do what I want.

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:37.520
Kourin-san...

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:39.980
I have a message from Shuurei-sama.

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:55.620
I understand. You should go back now.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.460
No, I'm going to save you!

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:00.580
Don't worry about me, just go back!

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:02.500
I'm all right!

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:05.380
No, you aren't! If I can just get this somehow...

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:07.840
You must go back, Kourin-san!

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:12.760
Go back. What if they notice you're missing before tomorrow?

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:19.600
The efforts that Shuurei-san and the others made to rescue all the captives will be wasted!

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:20.810
Isn't that right?

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:25.110
Of course, I know that!

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:29.620
But... I can't...

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:33.950
I can't just leave you like this, so wounded and tattered.

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:38.710
I found you. I chased and chased after you...

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:40.890
and finally found you.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:45.210
I'm staying beside you until the last moment!

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:53.180
Go back!

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:56.060
I won't!

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:01.650
Go back. There's no reason for you to stay here.

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:02.940
I don't want to.

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:04.980
If you stay here,

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:07.360
all will be lost.

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:12.610
If you wait till tomorrow, maybe everything will work out.

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:15.990
Perhaps I can stay alive.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:19.160
I don't like people who choose to die.

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:25.210
You promised that you were going to save the prisoners, didn't you?

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.760
Shuurei-san and I can't run away,

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:35.390
so please protect what's precious to me in my place.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:38.770
Eigetsu-sama...

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:44.270
Tomorrow, I'll get out by myself somehow.

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:46.570
Please don't come rescue me, okay?

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:49.280
You should leave with the others.

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.030
Stop being so arrogant!

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:54.360
I won't listen to you anymore!

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:59.490
Just promise me one thing.

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:02.330
Don't risk your life.

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:04.920
Promise me you won't die!

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:06.920
But...

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:09.000
the time I have left is...

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:10.670
Promise me.

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:14.590
I'm sorry.

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:17.890
I made you cry again.

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:20.720
I promise.

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:25.060
I promise, so please don't cry.

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:29.570
Now, go back.

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:54.220
Riou-kun? Ryuuren?

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:58.890
Ah, it's freezing!

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:00.060
I'm back!

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:04.350
Shuurei-onee-chan!

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:08.020
Morning, Princess! Did you sleep well?

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:10.610
Everything went well for us!

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:13.650
Ensei, did you see Ryuuren or Riou-kun?

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:16.110
Aren't they here?

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:18.070
Where could they be?

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:21.950
Ryuuren must have left for Mount Ei earlier.

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:24.870
Did you see him on the way back?

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:28.670
Dunno. We took a shortcut.

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:31.840
Anyway, we'll probably see him when we get there, but Riou...

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:36.760
Maybe he finished his errand.

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:37.550
What?

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:40.180
Riou isn't from Sekiei Village.

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:41.760
Really?

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:47.270
Yeah. He turned up one day and helped us care for the sick,

00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:50.770
but he said he'd leave when he's done his errand, so...

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:52.480
maybe he finished it.

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:00.200
One, two, three.

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:02.490
Hell of a lot today.

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:05.750
Let's use a larger cart.

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:08.160
Please take care of them.

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:39.530
Who on earth are you?!

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:46.750
I struck them with my flute.

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:52.500
Seriously, how rude of them to interfere with my reunion with soul friend number two.

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:00.220
So they're the last.

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:01.300
Yes.

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:13.360
I'll get out myself somehow.

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:15.360
Please don't come rescue me, okay?

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:22.700
I won't listen... no matter what he says.

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:28.580
Good luck!

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:31.790
I wonder how Seiran is managing.

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:34.170
You don't need to worry about him.

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:38.710
Sekiei Village was really empty.

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:40.130
Yeah...

00:11:41.670 --> 00:11:47.430
The disease took so many lives, but many lives could have been saved.

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:51.850
If only Jyasen-kyou hadn't spread that peculiar rumor,

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:56.770
more people could have obtained treatment and recovered.

00:11:58.220 --> 00:12:01.700
But... just to lure Eigetsu-kun and me here...

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:08.120
Such a joke. I don't care who it is, I'll never forgive the person hiding in Mount Ei!

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:11.370
That's right. Let's bring an end to this today!

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:13.330
But...

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:15.880
if that man is the one who's waiting for me,

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:18.130
then...

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:29.100
We're moving on now.

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:30.140
Yes, sir!

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:50.160
The woman governor is coming?

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:51.910
Yes, she'll arrive soon.

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:54.660
The trap is set up properly, I assume?

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:59.590
Yes, we've drawn an invisible circle at the center of the room.

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:06.930
Understood. So my job is done once she's lured here.

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:12.180
Hey, the purpose of this body was to lure To Eigetsu here, right?

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:15.100
I don't need it to face the woman governor, do I?

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:19.190
In that case, let me have my body back!

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:24.690
Oh, actually!

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:30.200
Can't you transfer my soul into To Eigetsu's body?

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:31.280
Huh?

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:34.910
To Eigetsu is going to die soon, isn't he?

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:39.830
In that case, can't you transfer my soul into that body as soon as he's dead?

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:43.960
If I have that body, then I wouldn't be useless anymore!

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:47.430
I'd become the one mother needs.

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:52.350
Rather than just that unruly Yougetsu,

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:56.230
wouldn't it be easier to control him if I was there as a restriction?

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:59.850
I see. We'll give it some thought.

00:13:59.850 --> 00:14:01.400
Yes, please think about it.

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:05.030
Well then, I'll go wait for the woman governor.

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:13.580
Ensei, look at that.

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:19.750
Ryuuren-bocchan knocked them out with his flute.

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:23.130
What? He just entered casually through the front gate?

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:26.590
No matter when or where you are, always be open and above board.

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:29.260
Why not? Saved us work.

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:32.850
Now, shall we go, Princess?

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:34.010
Yeah.

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:44.570
Damn it, it won't come loose at all.

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:47.900
After bragging that I'd get out by myself...

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:52.320
Won't someone come and help?

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:56.120
My consciousness is...

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:18.770
I wanted to have a word with you...

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:22.020
Sakujun-san.

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:25.360
Listen.

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:34.070
I'm not going to complain about your irresponsible, lazy, selfish, and carefree way of life.

00:15:35.070 --> 00:15:39.120
It's your life. Live however you like.

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:44.460
I do think you're absolutely good-for-nothing,

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:48.380
but I'm not angry because of that!

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:54.220
I'm upset because you chose to die!

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:59.720
Do you actually realize what you threw away?!

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:03.850
That life you discarded without a moment of hesitation,

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:08.650
do you know how many people wanted it?

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:11.990
All the people...

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:15.070
How much...

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:18.580
How much I longed for it.

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:24.870
I couldn't even promise tomorrow to the person I love.

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:31.340
I was so happy that Kourin-san came after me. Even so...

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:33.380
I...

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:37.600
I wanted to live!

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:41.640
Always, I've always wanted to live longer!

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:50.650
Even just for another second...

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:54.240
I wanted to stay longer with...

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:56.530
Yougetsu,

00:16:57.780 --> 00:16:58.530
Kourin-san,

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:00.160
Shuurei-san,

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:02.540
Ryuuren-san, and all the others.

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:08.920
I want to live... together with the people I love!

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:11.800
But you!

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:16.090
You just threw your future away like that!

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:19.430
That's why I'm angry at you!

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:23.350
Also, I'm upset about what you did to Shuurei-san!

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:26.060
You're the worst man! Making the one you love cry!

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:27.850
Well...

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:31.150
I also make her cry all the time.

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:36.320
We're both the worst, but you're the lowest of the worst!

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:37.160
The lowest!

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:43.200
If only I had more time,

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:48.370
I'd take tea with you, have a good long discussion, and...

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:52.750
By the way,

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:55.340
I'm not a cute squirrel or mouse.

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:57.510
I'm...

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:00.390
upset...

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:09.150
Where are you? Friend number two!

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:14.030
Eigetsu!

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:18.950
Wake up! Don't die, Eigetsu!

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:24.330
Huh?

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:26.750
Ryuuren-san, what's happened to you?

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:30.210
You're dressed so normally.

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:32.420
Eigetsu...

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:34.550
Ah, ouch, it hurts... Ryuuren-san!

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:35.880
Ah, I'm sorry.

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:40.380
Did Ryuuren-san rescue me?

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:43.680
I saw Sakujun-san before.

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:44.510
Eigetsu...

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:46.020
Yes?

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:47.730
Huh?

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:50.190
What's wrong, Ryuuren-san?

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:53.650
I forced you to drink alcohol before...

00:18:59.320 --> 00:18:59.990
I was...

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:01.990
Your life...

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:10.210
Ryuuren-san, you came to save me that time.

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:12.120
Isn't that right?

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:14.710
I failed to be your friend.

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:20.630
I like you a lot, Ryuuren-san.

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:23.680
You're a precious, important person to me.

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:27.430
That won't change, ever.

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:29.600
Eigetsu...

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:33.690
You came all the way here. That's more than enough for me.

00:19:35.310 --> 00:19:40.400
I'd like to stay as your soul friend number two, but you won't let me anymore?

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:45.530
You won't be my friend any longer?

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:51.040
I'd give anything for you not to die.

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:54.670
Wow, that's the best thing I've heard!

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:58.800
Were you looking for a way to keep me alive until now?

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:02.550
Thank you so much.

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:05.260
I'm such a fortunate man.

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:06.550
Eigetsu...

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:09.720
Something... There must be something.

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:11.930
There must be a way.

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:18.440
Okay, we'll stay together until the last moment.

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:23.780
There's a place I want to go. Will you take me there?

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:28.280
Let's go.

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:30.660
I'll take you anywhere you want.

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:33.620
My beloved friend number two.

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:43.970
Eigetsu-sama!

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:44.840
Ryuuren-sama?!

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:47.350
Ah, what?

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:51.100
Wh-What?! Ryuuren-sama, please hold on!

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:01.190
Ryuuren-san? Please stop.

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:05.200
Are you sure? You didn't want to get her into trouble, did you?

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:06.410
It's all right.

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:15.250
That was cruel! Leaving a woman behind and going ahead!

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:17.250
Kourin-san.

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:21.550
I told you I wouldn't listen to you anymore.

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:24.220
Kourin-san?

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:29.220
Eigetsu-sama, I've done everything I could!

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:33.270
You can't send me away now, even if you try!

00:21:37.350 --> 00:21:38.230
Kourin-san.

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:42.690
Here, let's go together.

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:49.200
I want to stay with you too.

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:51.500
Until the last moment.

00:21:53.740 --> 00:21:56.160
S-So sneaky...

00:21:57.330 --> 00:21:59.670
One moment you tell me to go, the next you tell me to stay.

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:03.210
All right.

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:06.970
I'll stay with you.

00:22:15.270 --> 00:22:16.270
Well then, shall we go?

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:21.560
My soul friend number two, and the soul friend of my soul friend number two.

00:22:23.520 --> 00:22:24.320
Huh?

00:22:33.780 --> 00:22:36.330
Senya's at the end of this passage.

00:22:37.080 --> 00:22:38.500
Princess, are you ready?

00:22:39.460 --> 00:22:44.300
If the man calling himself Senya, the man waiting at the end of this passage, is truly him...

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:47.300
I...

00:22:49.630 --> 00:22:51.340
Ensei, let's go.

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:17.160
Princess, have you ever seen that face before?

00:23:17.160 --> 00:23:18.910
Never. I don't know him at all.

00:23:20.460 --> 00:23:23.420
Welcome, Governor Kou.

00:24:45.460 --> 00:24:48.750
So you've finally shown yourself, the founder of Jyasen-kyou who calls himself Senya.

00:24:49.300 --> 00:24:52.260
I don't recognize your face at all.

00:24:52.880 --> 00:24:54.430
Who on earth are you?!

00:24:54.840 --> 00:24:56.760
Now, show your true self!
